We're a little over a month away from the launch of iOS 27, and Apple is continuing to make changes. The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/08/10/ios-27-beta-5-everything-new/">fifth beta of ‌iOS 27‌ seeded to developers and public beta testers this week</a> changes the look of some app icons and adjusts Liquid Glass, plus it adds some smaller features that make the iPhone just a little nicer to use.<br/>
<br/>
